  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is an annual event organized by MBSSE that is necessary to do stock-taking or a review of what has happened in education during the year, to look at what has been done well and what has not been done well, to celebrate successes and to learn from mistakes. The focus of the event is not on the past but rather using lessons from the past to inform plans, policies, and interventions.</narrative>
